# Agent UI auth (local)

The Cursor browser does not share cookies with your normal browser. Authenticated routes (`/settings`, `/invoices`, `/dashboard`, etc.) redirect to Clerk sign-in.

Before exercising signed-in UI:

1. Ensure `npm run dev` is running on port **3001**.
2. Run `npm run auth:agent` (optional: `-- --email you@company.com --redirect /settings`).
3. Open the **URL printed on stdout** in the Cursor browser.
4. Confirm you land on the redirect target signed in, then continue the UI flow.

Do not attempt Google SSO or fill the Clerk sign-in form in the agent browser. Do not use this against production / `sk_live_` keys — the script refuses those.
